* **Morrison Inn & The Village Tavern:** Casual options nearby in Morrison for burgers, pub fare, and comfort food before an event.\n* **Local BBQ:** Try **Wayne's Smoke Shack** in Morrison, **GQue BBQ** in nearby Golden, or **Moe's Original BBQ** in Wheat Ridge for smoked meats and brisket.\n\n### Festivals & Music Events\n* Keep an eye out for local music events and festivals such as the **Westword Music Showcase**, **Denver Folk Festival**, **Denver Jazz Festival**, or **Riot Fest**.","input_tokens":18198,"latency_ms":50396,"observations":[{"excerpt":{"chars":2000,"sha256":"82d20cf7f4a552d5cfa73513dae1a3c1ac5be5e4268607208231ddf2f61fbd77","withheld":"dataset text; see README"},"observation_id":"obs_uX9H0DEmfjvbI8Vwj8mz-","occurred_at":"2023-05-27T14:23:00Z","source_object_id":"a89d7624/answer_8f15ac24:5"},{"excerpt":{"chars":2000,"sha256":"ee535c8ff41e779afd4ede4776318123baccccf19b5b30c77aca5407d05efd88","withheld":"dataset text; see README"},"observation_id":"obs_VYkghaFUQXLCSmVJDsYvr","occurred_at":"2023-05-27T14:23:00Z","source_object_id":"a89d7624/answer_8f15ac24:7"},{"excerpt":{"chars":2000,"sha256":"e307758ef301ac6641d9fc931ce8ae04df19bc710e864cd88294f47a37a01cbc","withheld":"dataset text; see README"},"observation_id":"obs_sXFIDlkOrq0Gmt8sOM45M","occurred_at":"2023-05-27T14:23:00Z","source_object_id":"a89d7624/answer_8f15ac24:9"},{"excerpt":{"chars":292,"sha256":"43a1831407b751176e9f07ac9c7a4137badbc84ee07b6caba4125b7fc7104238","withheld":"dataset text; see README"},"observation_id":"obs_FN-GG57yRl8Tbpfx4SCHk","occurred_at":"2023-05-27T14:23:00Z","source_object_id":"a89d7624/answer_8f15ac24:4"},{"excerpt":{"chars":1280,"sha256":"388adff3387d69fd2fbbf5445e2a58ef4fd5a4e02d9c18f6c575fb176069ede9","withheld":"dataset text; see README"},"observation_id":"obs_aoSTzTq7zzv7mhfiqtpzG","occurred_at":"2023-05-27T14:23:00Z","source_object_id":"a89d7624/answer_8f15ac24:11"},{"excerpt":{"chars":160,"sha256":"fd811ff94c8b05837eda593c021b9f283d73d7a374638a26a43b37c65f375d